se measurement facets are one concrete consequence of the broader semantic ambiguity around mindfulness.\", \"status\": \"open\"}\n{\"relation_type\": \"supports\", \"src_claim_id\": \"claim-mindfulness-based-stress-reduction-and-compassion-meditation-have-been-reported--d470d02dbd8f\", \"dst_claim_id\": \"claim-meditation-practice-is-associated-with-physiological-profiles-of-relaxed-alertne--a46fa752f290\", \"rationale\": \"Immune and stress-reactivity findings provide concrete examples of meditation-related physiological regulation.\", \"status\": \"open\"}\n{\"relation_type\": \"supports\", \"src_claim_id\": \"claim-intention-motivation-attention-regulation-emotion-regulation-extinction-and-reco--002095abdbf2\", \"dst_claim_id\": \"claim-mindfulness-can-be-modeled-as-systematic-mental-training-that-reduces-biased-sel--6f2cabe951a3\", \"rationale\": \"The proposed component mechanisms explain how the three S-ART capacities are cultivated and integrated.\", \"status\": \"open\"}\n{\"relation_type\": \"supports\", \"src_claim_id\": \"claim-biased-narrative-self-processing-can-reify-dysfunctional-self-schemas-through-af--544c2f60e4c0\", \"dst_claim_id\": \"claim-mindfulness-can-be-modeled-as-systematic-mental-training-that-reduces-biased-sel--6f2cabe951a3\", \"rationale\": \"The dysfunctional narrative self model identifies the bias cycle that S-ART training is meant to reduce.\", \"status\": \"open\"}\n{\"relation_type\": \"supports\", \"src_claim_id\": \"claim-mindfulness-definition-is-ambiguous--4f220365d6f4\", \"dst_claim_id\": \"claim-self-report-measures-lack-validity--56550542660a\", \"rationale\": \"Ambiguous definitions make self-report measures harder to interpret as measures of a single construct.\", \"status\": \"open\"}\n{\"relation_type\": \"derived_from\", \"src_claim_id\": \"claim-research-needs-prescriptive-reform--79c0d54db997\", \"dst_claim_id\": \"claim-mindfulness-definition-is-ambiguous--4f220365d6f4\", \"rationale\": \"The recommendation for precise terminology follows from the paper’s diagnosis of semantic ambiguity.\", \"status\": \"open\"}\n{\"relation_type\": \"supports\", \"src_claim_id\": \"claim-the-clinical-evidence-base-for-mindfulness-based-interventions-remains-insuffici--fd5df4ed74a7\", \"dst_claim_id\": \"claim-mindfulness-based-interventions-show-mixed-and-condition-dependent-clinical-effi--ada76b44a400\", \"rationale\": \"An immature clinical research base helps explain why efficacy conclusions remain mixed and preliminary.\", \"status\": \"open\"}\n{\"relation_type\": \"derived_from\", \"src_claim_id\": \"claim-research-needs-prescriptive-reform--79c0d54db997\", \"dst_claim_id\": \"claim-clinical-evidence-remains-preliminary--117717456958\", \"rationale\": \"The recommendation for stronger study design follows from the weaknesses in clinical intervention methodology.\", \"status\": \"open\"}\n{\"relation_type\": \"derived_from\", \"src_claim_id\": \"claim-mindfulness-based-meditation-is-proposed-to-modulate-self-specifying-and-narrati--0ff3acc89706\", \"dst_claim_id\": \"claim-s-art-distinguishes-experiential-enactive-experiential-phenomenological-and-narr--3e3013b46122\", \"rationale\": \"The proposed fronto-parietal integration claim depends on the paper's parcellation of self-processing systems.\", \"status\": \"open\"}\n{\"relation_type\": \"supports\", \"src_claim_id\": \"claim-meditation-related-adverse-effects-are-under-assessed-in-current-trials-so-claim--ce66cec14da3\", \"dst_claim_id\": \"claim-mindfulness-and-meditation-practices-can-be-contraindicated-for-some-psychiatric--6fe966926b20\", \"rationale\": \"Under-assessed adverse events strengthen the need to treat contraindications and safety claims cautiously.\", \"status\": \"open\"}\n{\"relation_type\": \"supports\", \"src_claim_id\": \"claim-clinical-evidence-remains-preliminary--117717456958\", \"dst_claim_id\": \"claim-therapeutic-benefits-are-condition-specific--201401200700\", \"rationale\": \"The preliminary clinical evidence base constrains claims about broad therapeutic benefit.\", \"status\": \"open\"}\n{\"relation_type\": \"supports\", \"src_claim_id\": \"claim-adverse-effects-are-undermeasured--25fa20260426\", \"dst_claim_id\": \"claim-mindfulness-hype-exceeds-evidence--96cb023af909\", \"rationale\": \"Undermeasured adverse effects raise the stakes of public hype and overconfident implementation.\", \"status\": \"open\"}\n{\"relation_type\": \"supports\", \"src_claim_id\": \"claim-future-mindfulness-research-should-replace-generic-labels-with-precise-descripti--0291ee9277c4\", \"dst_claim_id\": \"claim-mindfulness-is-not-a-unitary-construct-it-is-an-umbrella-term-spanning-diverse-p--ab25afeeb846\", \"rationale\": \"The proposed feature and protocol descriptions are a remedy for the claim that mindfulness is semantically broad.\", \"status\": \"open\"}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
